    headline="CBD merchant account UK — full guide for UK CBD retailers"
    description="UK card processing for CBD businesses: why mainstream providers refuse, the UK acquirer panel (Trust Payments, Universe, Acquired.com), underwriting requirements, reserves, and the application process."
