    <p class="cta-note">Form coming soon. In the meantime, see the <a href="/high-risk/">high-risk hub</a> and the <a href="/high-risk/why-declined/">why-declined guide</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <Faq faqs={faqs} />
</BaseLayout>

